1
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:42,979
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:45,800
[Episode 5]

3
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,350
My Lord.

4
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:55,920
These are the clothes
you asked me to buy

5
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,850
for Fourth Lady.

6
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,860
Send them over.

7
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,400
Impressive, My Lord.

8
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:04,340
You could tell Fourth Lady's measurements
just by looking at her.

9
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,710
I misspoke.

10
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,150
Please forgive me, My Lord.

11
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,880
I'll send them over right away.

12
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:17,310
My Lord.

13
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:18,870
The Xie Residence

14
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,690
sent this over in the middle of the night.

15
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:25,079
Read it.

16
00:02:26,190 --> 00:02:27,590
"Respectfully addressed to Lord Yan.

17
00:02:27,590 --> 00:02:28,770
The chill of early spring
seeps through the curtains,

18
00:02:28,770 --> 00:02:30,150
and the night rain
shows no sign of letting up.

19
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:32,240
Our Fourth Lady is still weak
from her recent injuries

20
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,810
and may not be able to
make the journey home.

21
00:02:33,810 --> 00:02:36,250
We humbly ask that she be allowed to
spend the night at your residence

22
00:02:36,250 --> 00:02:37,650
to shelter from the cold.

23
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,150
We hear that a newly blossomed plum branch

24
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:41,079
has appeared in the courtyard there,

25
00:02:41,079 --> 00:02:42,360
its buds glistening with dew.

26
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,590
It would be most fitting

27
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:45,430
in the celadon vase by your bedside.

28
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:49,290
We'd be grateful if Your Lordship could
look after her for the night."

29
00:02:50,590 --> 00:02:52,390
The Xie family sure is generous.

30
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,470
Qinghe.

31
00:02:57,430 --> 00:03:00,560
You must copy these sutras carefully.

32
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:04,240
I just don't understand
what Old Madam was thinking.

33
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:06,120
Why would she betroth Qingyuan

34
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,590
to Lord Yan?

35
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:12,560
Mother.

36
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,440
What did you just say?

37
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,470
Did you just say

38
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:26,240
that Qingyuan would be betrothed

39
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,240
to Yan Rui?

40
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:34,190
Stop right there.

41
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,530
Where are you going?

42
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:40,840
You haven't even finished
copying the sutras

43
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,750
Old Madam asked you to copy yet.

44
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:42,560
Mother!

45
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,710
Fourth Sister is about to be thrown into
the lion's den!

46
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:48,710
How much longer are you going to
pretend you don't see what's happening?

47
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:51,440
If it weren't to protect me,

48
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:54,000
she wouldn't have crossed
Second Sister and Third Sister,

49
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,800
and she wouldn't have had to
take all the blame herself.

50
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,600
-Then she wouldn't...
-Enough!

51
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:02,010
More than a decade ago,

52
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:06,030
when Fourth Madam
was driven out of the residence,

53
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:07,830
I fought it every step of the way,

54
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:09,510
just as you're doing now.

55
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,900
And how did that go?

56
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,430
Did it do any good?

57
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,030
Did it change anything?

58
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:16,829
So this time, there's no need to
even put up a fight,

59
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:20,220
and we'll just let this be
the end for Fourth Sister?

60
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,390
Qinghe!

61
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,430
Qinghe!

62
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:36,159
Old Madam personally sent someone
to deliver the betrothal letter.

63
00:04:36,159 --> 00:04:37,560
It's already a done deal!

64
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,140
You look really beautiful

65
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,430
in this outfit.

66
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:08,030
Is that so?

67
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:11,030
Which girl was this meant for, Lord Yan?

68
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:14,870
Do you like it?

69
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,760
No need for the medicine.

70
00:05:21,870 --> 00:05:23,000
Thank you, Lord Yan.

71
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,240
Sit down.

72
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:53,830
Let me see.

73
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:56,070
What are you trying to do?

74
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:58,800
I'd never take advantage of
someone in distress.

75
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,190
Or is it because you think
this scar is unsightly

76
00:06:04,190 --> 00:06:05,920
and don't want anyone to see it?

77
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,480
If it hurts,

78
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,450
you can hold on tighter.

79
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,430
I would't mind.

80
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,260
Don't move.

81
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:00,600
Did you have to go that far with
playing the victim?

82
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,860
Thank goodness you didn't damage
any meridians.

83
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:04,820
Otherwise,

84
00:08:05,230 --> 00:08:06,230
you could've lost

85
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,960
the use of this hand for good.

86
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,250
At least I won my bet.

87
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,390
I'll be leaving then.

88
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,830
Tomorrow, I'll have these clothes
washed and...

89
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:17,830
Stop right there.

90
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:24,680
Xie Qingyuan.

91
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:28,070
So eager to settle accounts with me
and be done with it?

92
00:08:28,630 --> 00:08:30,390
Then tomorrow, I'll have Granny Chen

93
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:31,480
send over some more osmanthus candy

94
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,549
and medicinal dishes

95
00:08:32,549 --> 00:08:34,630
to make up for the cost of this garment.

96
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:35,270
Alright.

97
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,690
But you're not leaving today.

98
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,360
Mother.

99
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:56,910
Let's go plead with Old Madam, okay?

100
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,200
Please!

101
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,790
She's a daughter of the Xie family,
after all!

102
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,000
I'm begging you!

103
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,600
It's precisely because

104
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,530
you're daughters of the Xie family that,

105
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,200
in Grandmother's eyes,

106
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,840
you must make sacrifices
for the Xie family.

107
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:14,200
This is Qingyuan's fate,

108
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:17,090
just as it was her mother's

109
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,440
all those years ago.

110
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,120
This is Fourth Madam's fate,

111
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:26,630
Qingyuan's fate,

112
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,340
and even more so,
the fate of the two of us.

113
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,030
Is there...

114
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:36,120
Is there really no other way

115
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,910
to save Fourth Sister?

116
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:38,840
No!

117
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,890
Because we're in no position
to protect anyone else!

118
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:43,440
I have no authority over the household,

119
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,480
and you have no powerful husband
to stand behind you.

120
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,610
How are we supposed to protect anyone?

121
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,960
I know

122
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,930
I've let Qingyuan down.

123
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,750
But what can I do?

124
00:09:59,080 --> 00:09:59,540
Mother.

125
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:00,130
Mother,

126
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,000
get up.

127
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,440
Qinghe.

128
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,790
If you feel guilty toward Qingyuan,

129
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,270
then once she comes back
from the Yan Residence,

130
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:07,540
let's treat her well.

131
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,550
All right?

132
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:10,670
All right.

133
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:15,980
Come on, get up.

134
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,390
Qinghe.

135
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,120
I know

136
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,000
you're upset

137
00:10:23,150 --> 00:10:24,440
that Qingru threw away

138
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,640
your introductory gift,

139
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,480
but listen to me.

140
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:32,530
[Hanxiang Parlor]

141
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:32,240
You mustn't force your way into anything.

142
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:33,550
The Spring Banquet

143
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,440
is actually being held
by the Founding Countess

144
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,360
to choose a bride for her heir.

145
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:39,120
At a time like this,

146
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,540
you mustn't stir up any more trouble.

147
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:43,670
As for

148
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,870
Qingrong and Young Master Pei,

149
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,320
their marriage

150
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,360
is already set in stone.

151
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,630
We

152
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:56,040
mustn't entertain
any improper hopes either.

153
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,780
Do you understand?

154
00:11:02,790 --> 00:11:04,270
Fourth Madam

155
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:06,390
used to teach me how to write.

156
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:07,440
She said

157
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:10,720
as long as I copy the sutras 108 times,

158
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:14,630
it would ward off misfortune for me.

159
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:24,510
But in this household,

160
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,850
where would we find a Buddha to save us?

161
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:49,900
Take it slow!

162
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:50,960
It's flying.

163
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:54,290
Hurry up.

164
00:11:54,310 --> 00:11:55,160
Coming.

165
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,750
Spring is in full bloom

166
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:57,960
by Hongyao Bridge.

167
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,870
One branch split in two,

168
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,380
yet sharing one heart.

169
00:12:01,790 --> 00:12:03,320
On the Shangsi Festival,

170
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:05,550
orchids are worn as adornments,

171
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,200
and peonies are offered
as tokens of affection—

172
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,460
such elegant customs.

173
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,510
Madam Hu, your poem

174
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:13,450
fits the occasion perfectly.

175
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:16,720
[Madam Pei]

176
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,870
Our Lanshan is also at an age

177
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:18,670
when we should start
thinking about his marriage.

178
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:20,000
I thought this festival

179
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:21,200
would be the perfect opportunity

180
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,800
to find him a suitable match.

181
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,600
Excellent.

182
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,600
Although our Third Lady

183
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:29,960
lost her mother at a young age,

184
00:12:30,550 --> 00:12:32,750
she's always been raised under my name.

185
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:34,390
She's well-educated and well-mannered,

186
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:37,050
and I'm sure she'll be
just what you have in mind.

187
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:37,750
Good.

188
00:12:43,150 --> 00:12:44,010
Second Sister,

189
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:45,640
does this look good?

190
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,170
It's woven pretty well.

191
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,920
Yours is okay as well.

192
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,080
Today, these orchid knots

193
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,840
are meant to be given to the one you love,

194
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,170
in exchange for a peony.

195
00:12:57,720 --> 00:13:00,000
Mine is for Chunzhi.

196
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,360
What do you think?

197
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,450
It's pretty.

198
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,780
That's her.

199
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,390
Look, that's her.

200
00:13:22,390 --> 00:13:23,320
She's our Fourth Lady.

201
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:23,790
That's her.

202
00:13:23,790 --> 00:13:25,990
She still has the nerve to show her face?

203
00:13:28,630 --> 00:13:29,270
Madam Hu.

204
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,540
I heard

205
00:13:31,570 --> 00:13:34,170
some rumors about your Fourth Lady
last night.

206
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,790
Why didn't your family

207
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,640
set the record straight sooner?

208
00:13:39,610 --> 00:13:41,820
As the Head Madam,

209
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:44,210
I failed to discipline her properly.

210
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:53,680
So this is the Xie family's Fourth Lady.

211
00:13:53,910 --> 00:13:55,310
She's indeed beautiful.

212
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,240
Yes.

213
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:59,010
Fourth Sister.

214
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,750
Why are you so late?

215
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:03,550
Don't tell me you didn't sleep well
after spending the night

216
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:04,950
at Lord Yan's residence.

217
00:14:07,670 --> 00:14:09,270
"Orchids lush and fragrant,

218
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:11,240
their fragrance rising high."

219
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:14,510
I got held up by some family matters.

220
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,790
I can brush off idle gossip

221
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:18,390
from outsiders with a laugh,

222
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:20,000
but if even my own sisters

223
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:22,030
spread slander without a second thought,

224
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:24,630
don't you think
you're disgracing yourselves as well?

225
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:26,960
And worse, of ruining the reputation of
our Xie family's daughters?

226
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,440
You...

227
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:28,000
Today,

228
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,910
I'll teach you a proper lesson
on behalf of the Xie family!

229
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:30,970
What are you doing?

230
00:14:33,150 --> 00:14:35,000
Daughters of a prominent family,

231
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,150
slandering someone's good name
with nothing but empty words—

232
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:39,410
and she's your own blood sister, no less.

233
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,450
-Lady Prefect.
-Lady Prefect.

234
00:14:43,790 --> 00:14:46,720
Lord Yan sent Fourth Lady
to my residence yesterday.

235
00:14:47,270 --> 00:14:50,600
If spending a single night there
means her virtue is ruined,

236
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:52,360
then what does that make
our Prefect's Residence?

237
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,440
Some filthy den of vice?

238
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,720
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

239
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,600
My sisters are young

240
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,840
and spoke without thinking.

241
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,030
They overstepped their bounds.

242
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:01,630
I hope you will forgive them.

243
00:15:07,330 --> 00:15:09,930
[Heir to the Founding Count, Pei Guanling,
courtesy name Lanshan]

244
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,030
Ladies.

245
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,000
The Chuiwan match is about to begin.

246
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:13,800
Lady Prefect.

247
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,450
I've heard that back in the day,
you could hit

248
00:15:15,450 --> 00:15:16,480
9 out of 10 shots.

249
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,240
Could you treat us

250
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,700
to a demonstration today?

251
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:21,230
Oh, don't be silly.

252
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,080
Today

253
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:24,100
is for you young folks to have fun.

254
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,630
What business does
an old woman like me have

255
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:26,910
getting involved?

256
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:29,630
Still, it wouldn't be the same
without you

257
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:31,120
presiding as the judge.

258
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,440
It's Chunzhi!

259
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,770
Second Sister, wait for me.

260
00:15:40,770 --> 00:15:42,000
Chunzhi!

261
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:46,120
Qingyuan,

262
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,200
come with me.

263
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:48,270
Yes.

264
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:01,670
Qinghe.

265
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,850
Your handkerchief.

266
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:35,770
Magnolias suit you beautifully.

267
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:53,440
Chunzhi!

268
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,870
[Heir to the Marquis of Danyang,
Li Congxin, courtesy name Chunzhi]

269
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,120
Chunzhi!

270
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:08,680
Chunzhi!

271
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,030
Chunzhi!

272
00:17:16,109 --> 00:17:17,550
Chunzhi!

273
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,720
Chunzhi!

274
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,960
That was so accurate! Amazing!

275
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:35,790
Chunzhi.

276
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,350
Chunzhi!

277
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,110
Chunzhi!

278
00:17:57,350 --> 00:17:59,960
Chunzhi, are you tired?

279
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,320
Who said I wanted to marry Congxin?

280
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:07,320
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

281
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,750
Then why did you write his name

282
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:08,110
on your red ribbon?

283
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,400
That's because

284
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:11,610
he's the one I care about the most.

285
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:14,680
So it's him.

286
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,510
Li Congxin.

287
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,640
Chunzhi!

288
00:18:27,790 --> 00:18:29,650
Why is Lord Yan still not here yet?

289
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:31,390
You haven't heard?

290
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:34,710
Lord Yan had a lady
keeping him company last night.

291
00:18:34,790 --> 00:18:37,250
He's probably forgotten all about us
by now.

292
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:40,970
As they say, youth must have its fling.

293
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:41,880
Miss.

294
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,310
Miss.

295
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,730
Miss, please wait a moment.

296
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:47,920
You must be

297
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:51,290
the Fourth Sister the Xie family
recently brought back.

298
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:54,880
Is that the girl you're talking about?

299
00:18:55,270 --> 00:18:56,000
Fourth Lady?

300
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:58,960
I've heard quite a lot about you lately.

301
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,560
Is that so?

302
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,220
Then do you believe it, Young Master?

303
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:05,480
Look.

304
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:08,010
Now that you're standing here with me,

305
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,400
it won't be long

306
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,850
before these rumors

307
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,480
spread all over Hengtang.

308
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:15,920
This Fourth Lady of the Xie family
is really something.

309
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,110
Last night she was all over Lord Yan,

310
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,460
and look at her now—

311
00:19:19,510 --> 00:19:22,240
already chatting with
Marquis of Danyang's son.

312
00:19:25,350 --> 00:19:26,030
Is that so?

313
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,400
I don't care.

314
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:34,930
Last night she was still
flirting with Lord Yan,

315
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:37,590
and today she's already throwing herself
at Young Master Li.

316
00:19:37,590 --> 00:19:38,960
Just like her mother—

317
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:41,840
always resorting to
those seductive tricks.

318
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,070
Young Master, you made such a sharp turn
and reined in your horse just now.

319
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:45,240
Quite the display of gallantry,

320
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,550
basking in everyone's admiration

321
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:48,110
and indulging yourself in the moment.

322
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:50,110
But have you ever considered

323
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:53,280
that you could cause the horse
irreversible harm?

324
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:57,590
I can't help but wonder,

325
00:19:58,070 --> 00:20:00,680
do you truly love horses, Young Master?

326
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:06,790
Lord Yan has arrived!

327
00:20:12,350 --> 00:20:12,960
Lord Yan.

328
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,680
Greetings, Lord Yan.

329
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,880
Greetings, Lord Yan.

330
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,270
This Fourth Lady of the Xie family

331
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:23,030
certainly seems to be quite popular.

332
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:26,030
Even the Heir to the Marquis of Danyang
seems to have taken a liking to her.

333
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:26,790
That young man

334
00:20:26,790 --> 00:20:27,960
is the Marquis of Danyang's only son,

335
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,070
and he's always been
something of a womanizer.

336
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:30,160
Nothing like you, Lord Yan—

337
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,030
young, accomplished,

338
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,200
and handsome as ever.

339
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,310
Indeed. Indeed.

340
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,240
Take your seats.

341
00:20:37,550 --> 00:20:39,680
-Lord Yan, please.
-Lord Yan, please.

342
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:43,830
Chunzhi.

343
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:44,640
Look.

344
00:20:45,030 --> 00:20:47,360
What do you think of
the orchid knot I made?

345
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:48,280
Is it pretty?

346
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:49,690
It's pretty.

347
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:51,050
So where's your peony?

348
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:02,160
Ignore her.

349
00:21:04,590 --> 00:21:05,450
Fourth Sister.

350
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,920
Your Lord Yan is here.

351
00:21:10,110 --> 00:21:11,000
Lord Yan,

352
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,590
you came quite late today.

353
00:21:12,590 --> 00:21:15,160
Could it be that you lost track of time

354
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:17,270
with a beauty in your arms last night?

355
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:18,750
Well, I suppose I have

356
00:21:18,750 --> 00:21:21,280
that courtesan from Zuixian Tavern
to blame.

357
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,830
You certainly have fine taste, Lord Yan.

358
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:23,880
-That's right.
-You have great taste.

359
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,280
That courtesan. Indeed.

360
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:28,160
The Chuiwan match is about to begin.

361
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:31,560
Could you do us the honor of
checking the lots, Fourth Sister?

362
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:32,920
Chunzhi...

363
00:21:40,710 --> 00:21:42,350
It's time to draw lots.

364
00:21:43,350 --> 00:21:44,940
Time to draw lots.

365
00:21:57,350 --> 00:21:58,000
Done.

366
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,640
My turn. My turn.

367
00:22:04,660 --> 00:22:05,920
My turn. My turn.

368
00:22:05,940 --> 00:22:07,030
My turn. My turn.

369
00:22:15,750 --> 00:22:16,930
-Aren't you participating?
-Mine's blank, too.

370
00:22:16,930 --> 00:22:17,720
What a bummer.

371
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:18,830
-Let's go.
-What a bummer.

372
00:22:18,830 --> 00:22:19,700
-What a bore.
-Let's go.

373
00:22:19,700 --> 00:22:21,200
Why is mine blank, too?

374
00:22:21,250 --> 00:22:22,760
Let's go.

375
00:23:00,550 --> 00:23:01,070
Coming.

376
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:02,270
Hurry up.

377
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:04,790
Little fox—

378
00:23:05,310 --> 00:23:07,170
got so many tricks up her sleeves.

379
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,570
My turn. My turn.

380
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,400
Why are they all blank?

381
00:23:14,030 --> 00:23:15,030
Let's go. Come on.

382
00:23:20,350 --> 00:23:21,240
Chunzhi,

383
00:23:21,750 --> 00:23:23,010
we're on the same team.

384
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,400
Okay.

385
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:30,380
You two drew the same team too?

386
00:23:31,030 --> 00:23:32,960
Then let's see who comes out on top.

387
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:37,260
Lord Yan, it seems
you hold this Fourth Lady in high regard.

388
00:23:37,590 --> 00:23:38,200
Why,

389
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:39,830
Magistrate Guo?

390
00:23:40,030 --> 00:23:41,590
Do you know my mind so well?

391
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,920
I wouldn't dare.

392
00:23:44,790 --> 00:23:45,920
I've heard that

393
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:48,150
the Founding Countess promised

394
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:50,960
as long as Young Master Pei
wins this Chuiwan match,

395
00:23:50,960 --> 00:23:53,440
he can marry the woman he loves.

396
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:55,510
I wonder if

397
00:23:55,510 --> 00:23:57,270
he'll get what he wants today.

398
00:23:59,550 --> 00:24:01,150
So that's what this is about.

399
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,030
The match begins!

400
00:24:07,270 --> 00:24:09,170
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

401
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:17,210
Chunzhi.

402
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:17,790
Please.

403
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,200
Let's.

404
00:24:19,660 --> 00:24:21,900
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

405
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,070
Chunzhi,

406
00:24:21,310 --> 00:24:22,040
you can do it.

407
00:24:24,210 --> 00:24:24,860
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

408
00:24:30,110 --> 00:24:31,770
-Team Red scores!
-Nice shot!

409
00:24:32,070 --> 00:24:32,830
Nice shot!

410
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:38,200
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 0]

411
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:39,920
My turn.

412
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:48,830
Nice shot!

413
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,200
Team Blue scores!

414
00:24:50,710 --> 00:24:52,520
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 1]

415
00:24:54,350 --> 00:24:55,410
This is really fun.

416
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:01,590
Qingru,

417
00:25:01,590 --> 00:25:02,480
go get it!

418
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:05,440
Chunzhi,

419
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:06,920
I'm a little nervous.

420
00:25:07,070 --> 00:25:07,680
It's okay.

421
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:08,680
Don't be nervous.

422
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,080
This is so embarrassing.

423
00:25:41,270 --> 00:25:43,030
Chunzhi, I'm not playing anymore.

424
00:25:43,030 --> 00:25:43,590
It's okay.

425
00:25:43,590 --> 00:25:44,350
How about this?

426
00:25:44,350 --> 00:25:45,200
You watch me play,

427
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:46,260
and I'll teach you.

428
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,350
Okay then.

429
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:52,200
Come on.

430
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:54,190
I'm not very good at this.

431
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:55,030
It's okay.

432
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,100
I'll teach you.

433
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:12,880
First, hold it like this.

434
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:13,920
Swing it out.

435
00:26:14,750 --> 00:26:16,010
Then twist your waist.

436
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,480
Give it a push.

437
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:18,680
And that's it.

438
00:26:19,750 --> 00:26:20,310
Got it?

439
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:21,930
Give it a try.

440
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:37,120
Well done!

441
00:26:37,140 --> 00:26:38,400
Team Blue scores!

442
00:26:38,790 --> 00:26:39,550
How nice.

443
00:26:46,100 --> 00:26:47,420
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 2]

444
00:26:50,550 --> 00:26:51,010
Qingru,

445
00:26:51,310 --> 00:26:52,270
watch me.

446
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:54,350
See how I beat him.

447
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:55,690
You can do it.

448
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,520
Here it comes.

449
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:06,070
Go!

450
00:27:08,590 --> 00:27:09,920
Chunzhi, you're amazing!

451
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:11,200
Team Red scores!

452
00:27:16,660 --> 00:27:18,320
[Team Red: 2] [Team Blue: 2]

453
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:44,960
I'm feeling unwell.

454
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:47,190
If you win the Chuiwan match,

455
00:27:47,790 --> 00:27:50,550
you can decide
who you want to marry yourself.

456
00:27:52,640 --> 00:27:53,400
Are you okay?

457
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:55,960
I'm fine. Let's do it.

458
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:24,240
Then for the last ball,

459
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,770
you go ahead and tee off.

460
00:28:28,350 --> 00:28:29,080
Come on then.

461
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,270
Tie!

462
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:01,960
Halftime break!

463
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:04,640
It's okay.

464
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:06,450
There's still the next round.

465
00:29:15,110 --> 00:29:15,880
Chunzhi,

466
00:29:16,310 --> 00:29:17,710
show me how to play again.

467
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:19,110
Alright, then...

468
00:29:19,590 --> 00:29:21,050
Come here, I'll teach you.

469
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:23,640
Raise it

470
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:26,920
and swing forward.

471
00:29:29,830 --> 00:29:30,510
Lanshan,

472
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:31,480
are you okay?

473
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:32,510
I'm fine.

474
00:29:34,550 --> 00:29:35,310
Is he okay?

475
00:29:35,590 --> 00:29:36,590
He said he's fine.

476
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:38,580
Eldest Sister.

477
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:44,740
Fourth Sister.

478
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:45,850
What should I do?

479
00:29:46,590 --> 00:29:48,050
I don't think I can do this.

480
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:49,680
Madam Pei left again.

481
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,100
Eldest Sister.

482
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:53,400
Be patient.

483
00:29:55,070 --> 00:29:56,310
Looking at the way things stand,

484
00:29:56,310 --> 00:29:57,830
I'm afraid that even if Young Master Pei

485
00:29:57,830 --> 00:29:59,030
is clever and resourceful,

486
00:29:59,030 --> 00:30:00,830
it may still be hard for him
to turn the game around.

487
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:01,480
Someone!

488
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:03,270
I bet 50 taels

489
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,750
on Young Master Li to win.

490
00:30:05,030 --> 00:30:06,920
His Lordship the Prefectural Judge
bets 50 taels

491
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:08,920
on Young Master Li to win!

492
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:11,070
What if Young Master Pei

493
00:30:11,070 --> 00:30:12,800
has someone lending him a hand?

494
00:30:13,270 --> 00:30:14,730
I can't do anything right.

495
00:30:15,310 --> 00:30:17,710
I don't have the right
to choose my own path.

496
00:30:22,750 --> 00:30:23,610
Eldest Sister.

497
00:30:25,750 --> 00:30:26,610
Do you trust me?

498
00:30:31,030 --> 00:30:32,000
Lord Yan,

499
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:34,930
are you saying you want to
bet on Young Master Pei?

500
00:30:37,030 --> 00:30:37,680
Come here.

501
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,510
Lord Yan

502
00:30:39,510 --> 00:30:41,240
places a hefty bet of 500 taels

503
00:30:41,310 --> 00:30:42,770
on Young Master Pei to win.

504
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:43,680
Lord Yan

505
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:45,350
places a hefty bet of 500 taels

506
00:30:45,350 --> 00:30:47,160
on Young Master Pei to win!

507
00:30:50,880 --> 00:30:52,790
Lord Yan, you're truly generous.

508
00:30:56,310 --> 00:30:56,790
That's right.

509
00:30:56,790 --> 00:30:59,510
The higher you raise it,
the farther the ball will fly.

510
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:00,750
Yes, just like this.

511
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,030
Not bad.

512
00:31:18,550 --> 00:31:19,880
Alright, watch me play.

513
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,660
Just push it like this.

514
00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:26,520
The weather is so nice today.

515
00:31:27,110 --> 00:31:28,440
What were you chatting about

516
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:30,440
with Young Master Li just now, lady?

517
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:33,780
I believe it's none of your business.

518
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:39,720
Let's get ready.

519
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,880
The second half begins!

520
00:32:05,270 --> 00:32:06,680
Nice shot!

521
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:08,240
Team Red scores!

522
00:32:08,400 --> 00:32:09,750
Nice shot! Brilliant!

523
00:32:09,750 --> 00:32:11,310
You are amazing, Chunzhi!

524
00:32:21,120 --> 00:32:25,270
[Team Red: 3] [Team Blue: 2]

525
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,030
My turn.

526
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:27,790
Come on.

527
00:32:54,070 --> 00:32:55,830
As for Qingrong

528
00:32:56,030 --> 00:32:57,310
and Young Master Pei,

529
00:32:58,030 --> 00:32:59,590
their marriage

530
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,270
is already set in stone.

531
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:02,960
We

532
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:06,310
mustn't entertain
any improper hopes either.

533
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:11,890
Eldest Sister.

534
00:33:12,550 --> 00:33:13,810
Are you really willing

535
00:33:14,510 --> 00:33:16,790
to be a discarded pawn?

536
00:33:28,510 --> 00:33:29,400
Hold on!

537
00:33:49,270 --> 00:33:50,330
We concede defeat.

538
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:53,590
Why?

539
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:00,400
Then I will choose

540
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:03,830
this path myself.

541
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:16,630
They concede defeat?

542
00:34:16,630 --> 00:34:18,070
They're actually conceding defeat.

543
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:20,550
Then wouldn't Lord Yan's bet...

544
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,110
500 taels.

545
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:23,570
What a shame. What a shame.

546
00:34:27,590 --> 00:34:29,989
Your hand's injured.
Why didn't you say so?

547
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,230
Truth be told,

548
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,510
when it comes to young people's affairs,

549
00:34:38,510 --> 00:34:41,310
it's best to let them
do as they please and be happy.

550
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:48,400
Pei,

551
00:34:48,630 --> 00:34:49,590
it's just a game.

552
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:50,960
Why play while injured?

553
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:51,760
It's nothing.

554
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:52,850
Let's continue.

555
00:34:56,230 --> 00:34:58,090
Girls really are more attentive.

556
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:58,960
You,

557
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:01,490
on the other hand, just love to act tough.

558
00:35:02,550 --> 00:35:04,010
Please forgive me, Madam.

559
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:07,280
It's my fault that Young Master Pei
lost the match.

560
00:35:09,550 --> 00:35:10,320
Eldest Lady,

561
00:35:10,590 --> 00:35:13,070
may I have a look at your orchid knot?

562
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:26,800
Eldest Lady.

563
00:35:30,330 --> 00:35:37,160
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

564
00:35:37,180 --> 00:35:43,660
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

565
00:35:43,550 --> 00:35:44,590
As for your mother,

566
00:35:43,760 --> 00:35:51,400
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

567
00:35:44,590 --> 00:35:46,120
I'll figure something out.

568
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:47,710
Thank you, Madam.

569
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:58,820
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

570
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:05,890
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

571
00:36:05,980 --> 00:36:15,660
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

572
00:36:16,880 --> 00:36:23,890
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

573
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:30,920
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

574
00:36:24,630 --> 00:36:25,550
From the way

575
00:36:25,710 --> 00:36:27,170
he swung the club just now,

576
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:30,140
I could tell he has an old injury
in his right arm.

577
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,000
If you trust me,

578
00:36:30,950 --> 00:36:34,440
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

579
00:36:32,190 --> 00:36:33,230
concede the next round

580
00:36:33,230 --> 00:36:34,150
voluntarily.

581
00:36:34,470 --> 00:36:38,130
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

582
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:35,730
How can I do that?

583
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:37,760
Young Master Pei has always been
fiercely competitive.

584
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:38,840
He'd never agree to concede.

585
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:44,190
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

586
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:43,280
If you trust me,

587
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:44,880
I'd never lead you astray.

588
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:45,940
In this next round,

589
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:47,760
the only way to win is to concede.

590
00:37:05,630 --> 00:37:08,360
Today's match was truly
full of twists and turns.

591
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:10,110
What a clever scheme, Fourth Lady.

592
00:37:10,110 --> 00:37:11,360
I don't feel wronged at all

593
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,890
for losing these 500 taels.

594
00:37:14,550 --> 00:37:16,880
Lord Yan, you're making a fortune
every day here in Hengtang.

595
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:19,150
What's a mere 500 taels to you?

596
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,510
Alright.

597
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:26,400
Then I'll have to trouble you,
Eldest Lady Xie,

598
00:37:26,510 --> 00:37:27,630
to take our Lanshan

599
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:29,360
to see a doctor.

600
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:31,710
His mother often tells me

601
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:34,070
that when he was little,
he was terrified of needles.

602
00:37:34,070 --> 00:37:35,190
Whenever he had to get a shot,

603
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:37,550
he'd be as scared as a mouse.

604
00:37:38,150 --> 00:37:39,800
Keep an eye on him for me

605
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:41,730
and don't let him wriggle out of it.

606
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:43,630
Yes, Madam.

607
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:53,290
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

608
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,080
Everyone.

609
00:37:52,510 --> 00:37:54,030
Now that the Chuiwan match is over,

610
00:37:53,440 --> 00:38:00,780
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

611
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:56,080
young ladies and young masters,

612
00:37:56,110 --> 00:37:58,550
you may now give the orchid knots
and peonies in your hands

613
00:37:58,550 --> 00:38:00,760
to the ones

614
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,110
you love.

615
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:03,920
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

616
00:38:04,060 --> 00:38:07,390
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

617
00:38:07,620 --> 00:38:14,110
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

618
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:25,800
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

619
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:32,550
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

620
00:38:32,150 --> 00:38:33,280
How about

621
00:38:32,580 --> 00:38:36,030
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

622
00:38:33,590 --> 00:38:35,250
giving your orchid knot to me?

623
00:38:36,050 --> 00:38:39,820
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

624
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:39,840
Lord Yan.

625
00:38:39,970 --> 00:38:46,210
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

626
00:38:40,630 --> 00:38:41,510
You mean this?

627
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:45,630
Sorry,

628
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:47,550
I can't give it to you.

629
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:02,780
Fourth Sister!

630
00:39:03,960 --> 00:39:04,820
Fourth Sister.

631
00:39:05,550 --> 00:39:06,410
Fourth Sister.

632
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,730
Can you give your orchid knot to me?

633
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:11,710
Well...

634
00:39:12,190 --> 00:39:13,590
What are you looking for?

635
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:28,840
When did he steal my orchid knot?

636
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:38,340
Fourth Sister.

637
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:39,510
For you.

638
00:39:41,840 --> 00:39:42,800
Chunzhi,

639
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,670
how could you give your peony to her?

640
00:39:44,670 --> 00:39:45,840
She was just all over Lord Yan

641
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,030
a moment ago.

642
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:52,190
Yan Rui!

643
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:52,910
You...

644
00:39:53,110 --> 00:39:53,510
You...

645
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:57,590
Yan Rui,

646
00:39:57,920 --> 00:40:00,780
what right do you have
to make decisions for others?

647
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:01,360
And?

648
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:03,310
Young Master!

649
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,550
There are so many people here.

650
00:40:04,550 --> 00:40:07,080
Don't let your emotions
get the better of you.

651
00:40:15,280 --> 00:40:15,840
Chunzhi,

652
00:40:16,190 --> 00:40:16,720
let's go.

653
00:40:18,360 --> 00:40:19,230
Chunzhi,

654
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:21,190
we agreed to
go play Madiao cards together.

655
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,190
Come on, let's go.

656
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:24,180
Fourth Sister.

657
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:28,740
Are you coming with us?

658
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:36,480
Thank you, Young Master Pei.

659
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:37,710
It's getting late.

660
00:40:37,710 --> 00:40:39,710
Your mother must be waiting for you.

661
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:41,330
Please head home first.

662
00:40:42,030 --> 00:40:43,090
And what about you?

663
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:45,070
I have important matters
to discuss with Lord Yan.

664
00:40:45,070 --> 00:40:46,930
I'll return once we're finished.

665
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,880
Chunzhi, come on.

666
00:40:50,510 --> 00:40:51,030
Let's go.
